# Line-ending normalisation.
#
# Without this, a fresh checkout on Windows gets CRLF while the index holds LF,
# and the two are not interchangeable for anything that hashes file bytes. The
# skill audit computes a sha256 per file and a digest per package; the SAME
# package measured 2364 bytes in one checkout and 2417 in another, producing
# digests 8ce96f97... and 1206f8cc... for identical content. An integrity check
# whose answer depends on which checkout ran it is not an integrity check.
#
# Found 2026-08-03 when the audit suite passed in the main working tree and
# failed in a fresh worktree of the same commit.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
